10:10:15 settled
🔴 ledger in billing (prod-eu-1) cannot create pods because validating webhook cert-policy rejects calls: "x509: certificate relies on legacy Common Name field, use SANs instead". It reports "Internal error occurred: failed calling webhook "cert-policy.policy.example.com": failed to call webhook: Post…". Every error mentions it. Both failing apps use it. Affected: orders in shop.
Related alerts: 2 failed pod creations
To check the webhook's backend and timeout, run kubectl get validatingwebhookconfiguration cert-policy -o yaml
